If you have a lot of patience and think you can still kill the Wiz a few more
times, the following _might_ work.  Drop everything that you don't need to
fight the Wiz.  Basically, everything except the armor you still have & your
fighting weapon.  When the Wiz returns, just try to avoid him and let him
curse you a few more times.  Curse status of items is cyclic, so eventually
when he curses your ring again it should remove the curse that's already on
it.  I think it may even become blessed.  When this happens, immediately take
the ring off and wail on him!!  >:-)
